  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> The strain of bending your dragonmark to replicate a specific spell is so great, that you can only cast this spell once per day - even if you have focus points to cast it with. </p>\n<hr />\n<p>With the powers of your mark, you can restore any item to its full grandeur. You can restore an item as if you cast the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.dMKP4fkWx8V2cqAy]{Remake} spell.</p>"
    },
